WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.279
So this next story is just more funny than
anything else because we are obviously not

00:00:06.279 --> 00:00:08.019
going to see Donald Trump's tax returns.

00:00:08.019 --> 00:00:13.719
But remember how Donald Trump has been saying
since 2015 that if it were up to him, he would

00:00:13.719 --> 00:00:16.849
show us his taxes, but they're under audit.

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:21.390
If and when there ever no longer under audit,
he's going to release his tax returns.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.369
Now, that never made sense.

00:00:23.369 --> 00:00:27.539
Anybody who could think critically realized
it never made sense, because obviously not

00:00:27.539 --> 00:00:31.109
all of his recent tax returns would permanently
be under audit.

00:00:31.109 --> 00:00:34.050
And, of course, audits don't last years and
years.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.410
But in any case, it was an excuse.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:38.809
Trump gave for not showing his taxes.

00:00:38.809 --> 00:00:40.710
His personal attorney, Rudy Giuliani.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.790
Maybe it's his former personal attorney at
this point.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:43.790
I don't know.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:48.370
He went on Fox News and he said, listen, there's
got to be finality here.

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.200
Trump's taxes have been audited and it's been
closed and we're moving on.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.200
You can't.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.570
Now, again, Congress or investigators asked
for Trump's taxes.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:03.129
He's indirectly saying we need a final point
on this because the whole audit thing has

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.129
been closed up.

00:01:04.129 --> 00:01:06.720
Well, if the audits are done, let's see the
tax returns.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:07.720
Right.

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:10.080
Here is Rudy Giuliani himself saying it.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.361
They've been audited and it's fine.

00:01:11.361 --> 00:01:15.720
And these are now closed matters as far as
he's concerned, could make the argument that

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.720
they have no particularized need for it.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:19.430
He could also make the argument.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:22.450
They are not investigating any particularized
crime.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:25.560
They have no reason to believe that there's
anything wrong with his tax returns.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:29.651
I mean, all these tax returns have been, by
and large, maybe not the last one, but all

00:01:29.651 --> 00:01:31.420
of them have been ordered.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:35.120
All of them have been either passed on or
settled.

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:37.800
And there should be some finality in your
tax returns.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.990
In other words, we get audited.

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:41.990
We make a deal.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:42.990
We pay the government.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.690
We don't come after me forever for that.

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:47.980
And also, this is the president tonight.

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:53.340
There are literally 400, 4000 prosecutors
who could now come after his records.

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.370
I don't think the court ever thought of that.

00:01:55.370 --> 00:02:00.410
All these tax returns have been audited and
there should be finality.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:02.480
Rudy says, you know, you get audited.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.310
You make a deal and that's it.

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:09.890
He is saying there that the issue of the tax
returns is over because Trump is no longer

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:12.319
under audit and he has moved on.

00:02:12.319 --> 00:02:14.280
He's saying you do the audit.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:15.769
The audit ends and that's it.

00:02:15.769 --> 00:02:19.019
You don't keep looking at the same returns
that have been audited.

00:02:19.019 --> 00:02:21.810
He's admitting that the audits are done.

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:23.079
If they ever existed.

00:02:23.079 --> 00:02:30.349
Now, maybe even more interesting there is
Rudy saying Trump's audits aren't just done,

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:31.659
but they've been settled.

00:02:31.659 --> 00:02:36.400
When Rudy says that they've been settled,
it implies, again, you know, talk about self-inflicted

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.400
damage.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:42.159
You settle audits and pay fines when you've
done something wrong on your tax returns.

00:02:42.159 --> 00:02:48.189
And Rudy Giuliani there, again, just as an
aside, seems to say not only are the audits

00:02:48.189 --> 00:02:49.750
done, but they've been resolved.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:55.030
Sometimes, you know, you pay a fine and you
move on, which seems to be an admission that

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:59.020
Donald Trump has been deceptive enough on
his tax returns.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:03.999
You know, you can always claim it was a mistake,
but that he has had to pay fines.

00:03:03.999 --> 00:03:07.880
Make good or settle with the IRS when it comes
to his taxes.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:11.060
It's stunning that this is not getting more
attention.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:14.569
It's stunning that a lot of people used to
respect Rudy Giuliani.

00:03:14.569 --> 00:03:18.790
And again, the reminder is we're not going
to see the tax returns.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.680
Right, to be super clear.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.209
Trump was never going to release the tax returns.

00:03:23.209 --> 00:03:28.019
The Supreme Court's decision isn't going to
get them released before the election.

00:03:28.019 --> 00:03:33.609
And the important thing for us is we don't
need to see them to know how to vote in November.

00:03:33.609 --> 00:03:39.430
It's not like we're saying, you know, I on
one hand, I don't like these things Trump

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:40.430
has done.

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:42.409
And on the other hand, this wasn't so bad.

00:03:42.409 --> 00:03:47.069
But if I could only see the tax returns, I'd
be able to decide what to do in November.

00:03:47.069 --> 00:03:51.390
Take solace in that, even though we're not
going to see Trump's tax returns.

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:52.739
We don't really need to.

00:03:52.739 --> 00:03:58.769
We already know what we should be doing in
November when it comes to Trump versus Biden.

00:03:58.769 --> 00:04:03.489
And I think that's the if you're looking for
any positive takeaway from any of this, it's

00:04:03.489 --> 00:04:08.209
we've got enough information to know how to
vote in November without seeing Donald Trump's

00:04:08.209 --> 00:04:10.250
tax returns tonight.

